  "item_short_desc": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s D-Ring Expedition Web Belt is the ultimate multi-purpose accessory, designed for both everyday wear and practical utility use. Featuring a D-ring design, this web belt is free of traditional holes, allowing you to easily adjust it to your desired length for a secure and comfortable fit. Made from durable cotton material, the uniform belt is not just limited to holding up your pants &ndash; it can also function as lashing straps, tie-downs, and more, making it a versatile tool for any situation.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "5924",
  "description": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s D-Ring Expedition Web Belt is the ultimate multi-purpose accessory, designed for both everyday wear and practical utility use. Featuring a D-ring design, this web belt is free of traditional holes, allowing you to easily adjust it to your desired length for a secure and comfortable fit. Made from durable cotton material, the uniform belt is not just limited to holding up your pants &ndash; it can also function as lashing straps, tie-downs, and more, making it a versatile tool for any situation. Available in multiple sizes, this 1.25 inch wide belt fits most standard belt loops, making it compatible with various types of pants, including BDU pants, tactical pants, cargo shorts, and more. Whether you're heading out for an outdoor adventure or simply looking for a reliable belt for daily wear, the Rothco D-Ring Expedition Web Belt is a must-have addition to your wardrobe.</p>",
